{"at":"2026-02-27T17:03:22.650Z","userId":"admin","page":{"id":763,"status":"published","language":"en","path":"/docs/propertylist-mls-user-manual/your-account/mls-user-preferences/","title":"MLS user preferences","description":"Here you can change your password and your platform language and more.","body":"<article class=\"shortcode_info\" itemscope=\"\" itemtype=\"http://schema.org/Article\">\n\t<div class=\"doc-post-content \" id=\"post\">\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"shortcode_title\"><h1>PropertyList MLS user preferences</h1>\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"ezd-meta dot-sep\"><br></div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\n\t\t<div class=\"doc-scrollable editor-content\">\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"doc-content-wrap\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div data-elementor-type=\"wp-post\" data-elementor-id=\"9394\" class=\"elementor elementor-9394\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-fa03c4d e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"fa03c4d\" data-element_type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-65d3f58 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"65d3f58\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p data-sourcepos=\"3:1-3:283\">Here you can change your password and your platform language.</p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-bec92fe e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"bec92fe\" data-element_type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-8247976 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"8247976\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h3 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Changing your Password &amp; Platform Language</h3>\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-44d9399 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"44d9399\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\"><ol><li><span style=\"color: rgb(11, 18, 32);\">Click your Name at the top right of the desktop where you will see a dropdown.</span></li><li>Click “Account Settings”<br><br>Here you can easily change your platform/site language and your password.</li></ol>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-bdcb3bf elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"bdcb3bf\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h3 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Notification Settings</h3>\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-49d9b4a elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"49d9b4a\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p data-sourcepos=\"19:1-19:117\">Stay informed about important events and updates by setting up notification preferences. Configure notifications for:</p><ul data-sourcepos=\"21:1-24:0\"><li data-sourcepos=\"21:1-21:89\">Calendar Event notifications: Stay upto-date with the latest events you have in the coming week.</li><li data-sourcepos=\"21:1-21:89\">Account Summary notifications: Keep an eye on your trends and what the office and staff are acheiving.</li></ul></div></div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-1ad1860 elementor-hidden-desktop elementor-hidden-tablet elementor-hidden-mobile elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"1ad1860\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h3 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Manage Lead Preferences: coming soon</h3>\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-85280d9 elementor-hidden-desktop elementor-hidden-tablet elementor-hidden-mobile elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"85280d9\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<ul><li data-sourcepos=\"43:1-43:100\"><p data-sourcepos=\"43:1-43:100\">Personalise how leads are handled and organised within the MLS system.&nbsp;</p><ul data-sourcepos=\"45:1-48:0\"><li data-sourcepos=\"46:1-46:109\">Lead Assignment Rules:&nbsp;Assign leads to specific agents based on predetermined rules.</li><li data-sourcepos=\"47:1-48:0\">Lead Follow-up Reminders:&nbsp;Receive reminders to follow up with leads within specified timeframes.</li></ul></li></ul></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"doc-btm\">\n\t\t    </div>\n    </article>","seo_title":"PropertyList MLS user preferences • PropertyList Info Hub","seo_description":"MLS user preferences for PropertyList"}}